(67682,0,0,'I hear you, Hilda. Mogu mixin\' up with sha? I don\'t like that one bit! We\'d better bring this evidence back to the King. $n, thanks fer yer help today, but we\'ll take it from here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67716,0,0,'Oh! Brann, jus\' look at this claw! I have a creepin\' suspicion that these mogu are meddlin\' with some dark magic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67734,0,0,'Good work, $c. These blood elves are actively researching the mogu. It\'s clear that Garrosh is searching for artifacts of power, but we won\'t let him succeed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67801,0,0,'CANNONBALL!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67801,1,0,'For Theramore!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67801,2,0,'Monsters... all of yeh... *sputter*',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
