(67833,1,0,'The Mercurial Guardian\'s skin becomes as hard as silver!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67834,0,0,'If I am correct, $n, then this... Divine Bell... is exactly the type of weapon that Garrosh is looking for. Return to your other duties for now. I will bring this information to the Warchief myself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67940,0,0,'Time is of the essence, $n. Proveditor Grantley may be able to help you get back to Stormwind. Of course, everything has a price.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,0,'Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,1,'I don\'t know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,2,'Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68006,0,3,'I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68287,0,0,'Garrosh, please. There may be another way. One that requires no bloodshed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(68287,1,0,'Let us use persuasion, not force. I have here a cask of pandaren Memory Wine. It will allow us to see into Shan Kien\'s past.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(68336,0,0,'Use the Kor\'kron Disguise, then search for intel in the middle of Garrosh\'ar Advance.',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68336,1,0,'I am losing patience, Shan Kien. Tell me where I can find the Divine Bell!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(68336,2,0,'Ishi, draw your blade. A few carefully delivered cuts will change his mind.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(68336,3,0,'Speak, then!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(68339,0,0,'Kill me if you must, but I owe no allegiance to you or your Horde. The only master I serve is the Thunder King.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68375,0,0,'WHAT?! You saw where the mogu hid the Divine Bell? I\'ll alert Lion\'s Landing immediately. We gotta get this thing before Garrosh. We\'ll contact you as soon as we find it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(68417,0,0,'Pssssst! Hey, over here, it\'s me, Agent Connelly! Don\'t blow our disguise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68417,1,0,'So Garrosh is looking for something called the Divine Bell? Whatever that is, it can\'t be good. I\'ll get this information back to headquarters.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68417,2,0,'Excellent work! I\'ll be in touch soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68551,0,0,'Light... I see... light. Finally, after centuries of silence, someone comes at last.',12,0,100,0,0,34197,''),
(68551,1,0,'I have kept the Bell safe as promised, Master.',12,0,100,0,0,34198,''),
(68551,2,0,'Wait... you are not mogu! Intruders!',12,0,100,0,0,34199,''),
(68551,3,0,'Guardians, awaken! Destroy those who would steal the Thunder King\'s treasure!',12,0,100,0,0,34200,''),
(68718,0,0,'I got a bad feelin\' about this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68718,1,0,'Your Warchief has got that bell, and he\'s goin\' to use it to make the Horde stronger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68718,2,0,'But I think that bell has got some power... and it\'s bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68718,3,0,'Nobody, not hozen, not human, not orc... should use the sha.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68718,4,0,'Be careful.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68718,5,0,'I hope I see you again, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,0,0,'It\'s about time ye showed up. Doomsday is a comin\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,1,0,'Garrosh is amassing his troops on the northern side of Kun-Lai Summit.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,2,0,'He\'s going to use the Divine Bell, and Light help us if we can\'t stop \'im in time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,3,0,'Anduin went on ahead. That cheeky, light-spoutin\', clod-brained fool!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,4,0,'Boy\'s naive enough ta think he can change the Horde \'an save the world... but... he\'s still just a child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,5,0,'Ye\'ve either got to stop the boy or help him... one o\' the two!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,6,0,'We\'re amassin\' an army to head Garrosh off, but that will take time, and the Prince may already be in danger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,7,0,'Oh, why can\'t this dang kite go faster?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,8,0,'Quick - they haven\'t spotted us yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,9,0,'I\'ll go back fer reinforcements.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68740,10,0,'Whatever ye do today, hero, ye\'re doin\' fer all the Alliance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68815,0,0,'Who dares disturb the Korune? You shall pay for your insolence!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70126,0,0,'YES! Finally! I won a Brawler\'s Guild invite! Nobody can stop me now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70126,0,1,'Everyone look! I won a Brawler\'s Guild invite! I can\'t wait to try it out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70126,0,2,'I won a Brawler\'s Guild invitation just now! I\'ll surely be rank 8 by tonight!  I sure hope I don\'t lose my ticket before I get there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70126,1,0,'I guess I wasn\'t ready to be a brawler.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70358,0,0,'You\'re here! The Regent Lord had asked about you specifically. Are you ready to go?',12,0,100,0,0,35349,''),
(71107,0,0,'Ah, the young black dragon graces my temple. The deeds of you and your champion are quickly becoming Pandaren legend.',12,0,100,1,0,37347,''),
(71107,1,0,'Tell me, young prince: What is the nature of strength?',12,0,100,1,0,37348,''),
(71107,2,0,'You speak only in terms of one\'s enemies.',12,0,100,1,0,37349,''),
(71107,3,0,'How so?',12,0,100,1,0,37350,''),
(71107,4,0,'A black dragon, through and through. Very well, I will give you my blessing, but also some advice:',12,0,100,1,0,37351,''),
(71107,5,0,'Strength used in the service of others is twice as powerful as strength spent on our foes.',12,0,100,1,0,37352,''),
(71107,6,0,'Now. My challenge, should you accept it, will test your ability to stand right in the face of danger and persevere.',12,0,100,1,0,37353,''),
(71107,7,0,'Let the challenge begin! Hero, you must defeat the Black Prince in close-quarters combat.',12,0,100,1,0,37343,''),
(71107,8,0,'You, my dark prince, will be blindfolded.',12,0,100,2,0,37371,''),
(71107,9,0,'Black Prince, you are very strong. But what good is strength without the vision to guide it?',12,0,100,1,0,37345,''),
(71144,0,0,'So enters the dragon, and his mortal champion. You are welcome here.',12,0,100,402,0,37274,''),
(71144,1,0,'Tell me, Black Prince: What is the nature of fortitude?',12,0,100,402,0,37275,''),
(71144,2,0,'You confuse strength with fortitude, young dragon. But power is worthless without spirit!',12,0,100,402,0,37276,''),
(71144,3,0,'I have seen humble slaves endure unimaginable torture, only to rise up and overthrow their masters.',12,0,100,402,0,37277,''),
(71144,4,0,'And I have seen the mightiest of emperors laid low by the perseverance of the smallest of enemies.',12,0,100,402,0,37278,''),
(71144,5,0,'Precisely!',12,0,100,1,0,37279,''),
(71144,6,0,'Of course you did. We will put your understanding to the test.',12,0,100,1,0,37280,''),
(71144,7,0,'My challenge, if you accept it, will test your champion\'s ability to defend and protect while enduring terrible hardship.',12,0,100,402,0,37281,''),
(71169,0,0,'My my, the child of the Worldbreaker, proof that none are beyond redemption. I am honored by your visit.',12,0,100,1,0,37249,''),
(71169,1,0,'Tell me, son of the Earth-Warder: What is the nature of hope?',12,0,100,1,0,37250,''),
(71169,2,0,'You speak, but doubt your own words.',12,0,100,1,0,37251,''),
(71169,3,0,'You underestimate me.',12,0,100,1,0,37252,''),
(71169,4,0,'Rise, son of Deathwing. I will give you my blessing, for you need it more than any I have ever met.',12,0,100,1,0,37253,''),
(71169,5,0,'I challenge you not to think of hope as a vague and unimaginable future.',12,0,100,1,0,37254,''),
(71169,6,0,'Live EVERY day with hope in your heart. In doing so, you CREATE the future you dream of.',12,0,100,1,0,37255,''),
(71169,7,0,'My challenge, if you accept it, tasks you with healing the most grievous of wounds.',12,0,100,1,0,37256,''),
(71352,0,0,'To do what is right, no matter the cost. That is wisdom.',12,0,100,1,0,37450,''),
(71352,1,0,'When is it ever wise not to act for the greater good?',12,0,100,1,0,37451,''),
(71876,0,0,'Hey, meat sack! If you got five minutes, come talk to me! I got no body!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71952,0,0,'Then let us begin.',14,0,100,0,0,38024,''),
(71952,1,0,'When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?',14,0,100,0,0,38026,''),
(71952,2,0,'Your hope shines brightly, and even more brightly when you work together to overcome. It will ever light your way in even the darkest of places.',14,0,100,0,0,38025,''),
(71952,3,0,'Do not give up on yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,38027,''),
(71952,4,0,'Believe in one another, and let others carry hope for you!',14,0,100,0,0,38028,''),
(71952,5,0,'Without hope, there is no brightness in the future!',14,0,100,0,0,38029,''),
(71952,6,0,'Create the destiny you seek!',14,0,100,0,0,38030,''),
(71953,0,0,'Ha ha! The trial commences!',14,0,100,0,0,38211,''),
(71953,1,0,'Strength. It is far more than simple physical prowess. When you are truly tested, will you be able to tell the difference between strength and power?',14,0,100,0,0,38213,''),
(71953,2,0,'You are strong, stronger even than you realize. Carry this thought with you into the darkness ahead, and let it shield you.',14,0,100,0,0,38212,''),
(71953,3,0,'Return twice as powerful!',14,0,100,0,0,38214,''),
(71953,4,0,'Believe in your strength!',14,0,100,0,0,38215,''),
(71953,5,0,'You have the power to change your destiny!',14,0,100,0,0,38216,''),
(71953,6,0,'Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!',14,0,100,0,0,38217,''),
(71954,0,0,'Today, you will face many trainers, who have honed their skills and proven themselves.  Will your pets tell the same story about you?  We shall see!  Good luck!',14,0,100,0,0,38032,''),
(71954,1,0,'Can you stand on the tallest peak, winds and sleet buffeting your skin, until the trees wither and the mountains fall into the sea?',14,0,100,0,0,38757,''),
(71954,2,0,'Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead.',14,0,100,0,0,38756,''),
(71954,3,0,'You must persevere!',14,0,100,0,0,38758,''),
(71954,4,0,'The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting.',14,0,100,0,0,38759,''),
(71954,5,0,'You are the mountain, unmovable by all but time.',14,0,100,0,0,38760,''),
(71954,6,0,'Be vigilent in your stand, or you will never achieve your goals.',14,0,100,0,0,38761,''),
(71955,0,0,'The trial begins!',14,0,100,0,0,38222,''),
(71955,1,0,'The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?',14,0,100,0,0,38224,''),
(71955,2,0,'Your wisdom has seen you through this trial. May it ever light your way out of dark places.',14,0,100,0,0,38223,''),
(71955,3,0,'Learn from your mistakes!',14,0,100,0,0,38225,''),
(71955,4,0,'Listen to your inner voice, and seek out the truth!',14,0,100,0,0,38226,''),
(71955,5,0,'Do not let your judgement be clouded in trying times!',14,0,100,0,0,38227,''),
(71955,6,0,'Always consider the consequences of your actions!',14,0,100,0,0,38228,''),
(71987,0,0,'Ooo oOOo ooOoO',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71987,0,1,'ooo OoOooO oo',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71987,0,2,'o OOooO OoooO',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(71987,0,3,'oOO OOooO',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(72151,0,0,'Almost... got... it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(72151,1,0,'Well that was unexpected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(72970,0,0,'The eons have awakened me.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(72994,0,0,'Be careful. I would not want you to fall into the arena.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(73037,0,0,'Please, come down. How am I ever going to explain this to the rest of the Tillers?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(73037,0,1,'If you fall off, I\'m not going in after you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(73303,0,0,'Long ago, the Jade Serpent instructed me to purify my spirit and become one with the land, my doubts were vanquished.',14,0,100,0,0,38036,'Emperor Shaohao - Yulon Intro'),
(73303,1,0,'When my journey began, I was reckless in my strength. The White Tiger taught me control. My hatred, anger, and violence were vanquished.',14,0,100,0,0,38037,'Emperor Shaohao - Xuen Intro'),
(73303,2,0,'The Red Crane saw hope in me, and instructed me to look inward. Despite my visage of despair, I found this hope, and the despair was vanquished.',14,0,100,0,0,38038,'Emperor Shaohao - Chi-Ji'),
(73303,3,0,'In the face of great fear, the Black Ox taught me fortitude. Through terror and darkness it persevered. The fear was vanquished.',14,0,100,0,0,38039,'Emperor Shaohao - Niuzao'),
(73303,4,0,'You have walked the trial of wisdom, and learned of the path of the Jade Serpent. May you learn from this lesson, as I did.',14,0,100,0,0,38040,'Emperor Shaohao - Yulon Outro'),
(73303,5,0,'You have walked the trial of strength, and learned of the path of the White Tiger. May you remember this lesson, always.',14,0,100,0,0,38041,'Emperor Shaohao - Xuen Outro'),
(73303,6,0,'You have walked the trial of hope, and learned of the path of the Red Crane. May it guide your footsteps through time.',14,0,100,0,0,38042,'Emperor Shaohao - Red Crane Outro'),
(73303,7,0,'You have walked the trial of fortitude, and learned of the path of the Black Ox. May it bless your passage.',14,0,100,0,0,38043,'Emperor Shaohao - Niuzao Outro'),
(73303,8,0,'Welcome to a very special trial!  The wisdom of a leader is reflected in the greatness of his followers. Let us see if your training has truly inspired those you lead...',14,0,100,0,0,38044,'Emperor Shaohao - Intro'),
(73435,0,0,'Dare ta drink a Dragon P.I.E.! It\'ll put hair on yer chest, and then hair on THAT!',12,0,100,4,0,0,''),
(73435,0,1,'GRUB N\' GROG!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73435,0,2,'Ye won\'t find anythin\' like it elsewhere. Come and try!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73435,0,3,'The perfect mix of northern and southern styles!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(73618,0,0,'You there! Come and try some Greenstone Brew!',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(73618,0,1,'Greenstone Brew! Straight from the heart of the Jade Forest.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73618,0,2,'Nothing beats the bold bite of Greenstone Brew!',12,0,100,4,0,0,''),
(73622,0,0,'Delicious food and drink at  reasonable prices!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73622,0,1,'Hungry? Thirsty? Tired? Let Graceful Swan take care of you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73622,0,2,'Come rest your weary feet, adventurer!',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(73647,0,0,'Exotic, aromatic, a brew good for both body and spirit!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73647,0,1,'Brave the brew that\'s truly unique! Invigorating, satisfying... amber-brew!',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(73647,0,2,'Exquisite amber-brew from beyond the Serpent\'s Spine!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73651,0,0,'It\'s Stormstout time!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73651,0,1,'Stormstout. Probably the best brew in Azeroth.',12,0,100,273,0,0,''),
(73651,0,2,'When you say Stormstout, you\'ve said it all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73651,0,3,'If you\'ve got the time, we\'ve got the brew. Stormstout!',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(73651,0,4,'Stormstout. Pandaren for "beer."',12,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(73656,0,0,'Arms and armor repaired!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73656,0,1,'Don\'t be caught unprepared! Let Crafter Kwon see to your gear!',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(73656,0,2,'Blades sharpened! Armor mended!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73657,0,0,'Come, sit down, enjoy a meal!',12,0,100,70,0,0,''),
(73657,0,1,'Delicious dishes and fresh-made island delicacies!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73657,0,2,'For the finest food, look no further!',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(73812,0,0,'Steaming goat noodle: NUMBER ONE!',12,0,100,51,0,0,''),
(73812,0,1,'Come fill belly with noodle, yes! Very good!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73812,0,2,'Noodle so tasty! You come try, yes?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73813,0,0,'Please try my Harmonious River Noodles. They will not disappoint.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(73813,0,1,'Fresh fish, caught within the hour! ...I think? Curse this island.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73813,0,2,'River style noodles, made with only the freshest fish.',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(73813,0,3,'Harmonious River Noodles!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73814,0,0,'Monmon study MANY weeks with master noodle chef.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73814,0,1,'I got good noodles here!',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(73814,0,2,'BUY NOODLES!',12,0,100,4,0,0,''),
(73815,0,0,'HOT AND HEARTY! Come try Yaungolian noodles!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(73815,0,1,'Bold flavor, bold heat! No other noodles come close!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73815,0,2,'Why settle for weak, flavorless noodles? Try them yaungolian style!',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(73816,0,0,'You will find only the best noodles in all Pandaria here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(73816,0,1,'Please come enjoy my fine Golden Dragon Noodles.',12,0,100,2,0,0,''),
(73816,0,2,'Golden Dragon Noodles! The very BEST!',12,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(73817,0,0,'So tasty! So delicious! Double Lucky special noodles!',12,0,100,396,0,0,''),
(73817,0,1,'Hey hey! Come here, have some tasty noodles!',12,0,100,3,0,0,''),
(73817,0,2,'Yoo-hoo! Come try some Lucky Mushroom Noodles?',12,0,100,24,0,0,''),
(73817,0,3,'Lucky-Lucky! Come have some noodles!',12,0,100,22,0,0,'');
